{
  "description": "`http:path` admits a path that matches its template, a parameter standing for one non-empty segment, as OpenAPI and every router read one (staged plan S4.1, ADR 0086): the built-in HTTP component runs it, as the native engine registers it",
  "input": {
    "kind": "spec",
    "spec": {
      "description": "get an order",
      "requires": [
